<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113473" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χασμ-άομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yawn, gape,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόταν χασμᾷ</span> when <i>you are
				gaping,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				824
			</span></i> (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				719a19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τοὺς χασμωμένους ὁρῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Chrm.</u>
					169c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλιγγιᾶν καὶ χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					486b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				527a
			</span></i>; of a door, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς θύρας χασμωμένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					257
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ χασμώμενοι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κεχηνότες</span>
			, <i>gabies,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				49
			</span></i>.</div>
